---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | All Dent PDR';
const description = 'Privacy policy for All Dent PDR. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.';
const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: 'https://alldentpdr.com' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: 'https://alldentpdr.com/privacy-policy' }
];
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical="https://alldentpdr.com/privacy-policy" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} noindex={false}>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> May 30, 2026<br/>
      <strong>Last Updated:</strong> May 30, 2026</p>

      <p>All Dent PDR ("we," "us," or "our") operates the website <a href="https://alldentpdr.com">alldentpdr.com</a> and uses various advertising and lead generation platforms, including Meta (Facebook and Instagram). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and protect your personal information.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following types of personal information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact information</strong> — name, phone number, email address</li>
        <li><strong>Vehicle information</strong> — year, make, model, VIN</li>
        <li><strong>Insurance information</strong> — insurer name, claim number (when applicable)</li>
        <li><strong>Usage data</strong> — pages visited, time on site, referring URL, browser type, IP address</li>
        <li><strong>Lead form data</strong> — information you submit through Meta lead ads, contact forms, or quote request forms</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Collect Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Directly from you</strong> — when you fill out a contact form, request a quote, register a vehicle, or submit a lead ad on Facebook or Instagram</li>
        <li><strong>Automatically</strong> — through cookies, the Meta Pixel, Google Analytics, and similar technologies when you visit our website</li>
        <li><strong>From Meta</strong> — when you interact with our lead ads on Facebook or Instagram, Meta shares the information you provide with us pursuant to Meta's own policies</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your personal information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to your inquiry or quote request</li>
        <li>Schedule and complete paintless dent repair services</li>
        <li>Process insurance claims and release forms</li>
        <li>Send job status updates and service-related communications</li>
        <li>Improve our website and advertising campaigns</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>4. Meta Pixel &amp; Advertising</h2>
      <p>Our website uses the <strong>Meta Pixel</strong> (Facebook Pixel), a piece of code that helps us measure the effectiveness of our advertising by understanding the actions visitors take on our site. The Meta Pixel may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pages you visit on our website</li>
        <li>Actions you take (e.g., submitting a contact form)</li>
        <li>Your IP address, browser information, and device identifiers</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This data is processed by Meta Platforms, Inc. in accordance with <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meta's Privacy Policy</a>. You can opt out of Meta's data collection at <a href="https://www.facebook.com/adpreferences/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook Ad Preferences</a> or through the <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digital Advertising Alliance opt-out</a>.</p>

      <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies for analytics and advertising purposes. You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences. Disabling cookies may affect certain features of our website.</p>

      <h2>6. How We Share Your Information</h2>
      <p>We may share your information with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service providers</strong> — companies that help us operate our website or business (e.g., email delivery, CRM tools), bound by confidentiality obligations</li>
        <li><strong>Insurance companies</strong> — when processing a claim on your behalf, with your consent</li>
        <li><strong>Meta Platforms</strong> — as described in Section 4 above</li>
        <li><strong>Legal authorities</strong> — when required by law or to protect our rights</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal information.</p>

      <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to provide services, comply with legal obligations, and resolve disputes. Lead and customer records are typically retained for up to 5 years.</p>

      <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
        <li>Opt out of marketing communications at any time</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:alldentpdr@gmail.com">alldentpdr@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our services are not directed to individuals under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such information, please contact us immediately.</p>

      <h2>10. Security</h2>
      <p>We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. However, no transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>

      <h2>11. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to third-party sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review their privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. The "Last Updated" date at the top will reflect any changes. Continued use of our website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

      <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
      <address>
        <strong>All Dent PDR</strong><br/>
        7695 Granger Rd<br/>
        Cleveland, OH 44125<br/>
        Phone: <a href="tel:18554255336">1-855-425-5336</a><br/>
        Email: <a href="mailto:alldentpdr@gmail.com">alldentpdr@gmail.com</a>
      </address>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
  ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  address { font-style: normal; line-height: 1.8; }
  p, li { line-height: 1.7; }
</style>
